<header class="page-header">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">TOOLS / Templates</p>
<h1>메시지 템플릿</h1>
<p class="page-description">Discord에 도착할 메시지를 나만의 형식으로 만들어 보세요.</p>
</div>
<button class="primary" data-open-dialog="new-template-modal">{{> icon name="plus"}}템플릿 만들기</button>
</header>
<section data-page="templates">
<div class="preset-intro">
<div class="preset-intro-icon">{{> icon name="template"}}</div>
<div>
<h2>좋은 알림은 읽기 쉬운 메시지부터</h2>
<p>장애 공지, 뉴스, 토론, 간결한 링크까지. 내장 프리셋을 복제해 시작하세요.</p>
</div>
</div>
<section class="panel table-panel">
<div class="panel-header">
<div>
<h2>템플릿 라이브러리</h2>
<p>템플릿을 선택하면 편집기와 Discord 미리보기가 열립니다.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="table-scroll">
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>템플릿 이름</th>
<th>식별자</th>
<th>종류</th>
<th>복제 / 관리</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody id="template-table">{{#each templates}}{{> template-row}}{{else}}<tr data-empty-row>
<td colspan="4" class="empty-inline">아직 템플릿이 없습니다.</td>
</tr>{{/each}}</tbody>
</table>
</div>
</section>
<dialog id="new-template-modal" class="app-dialog" aria-labelledby="new-template-title">
<div class="modal-header">
<div>
<p class="eyebrow">NEW TEMPLATE</p>
<h2 id="new-template-title">메시지 템플릿 만들기</h2>
</div>
<button class="icon-button" data-close-dialog aria-label="닫기">{{> icon name="close"}}</button>
</div>
<form id="new-template-form" hx-post="/api/templates" hx-target="#template-table" hx-swap="beforeend" data-close-on-success>
<div class="modal-body form-grid">
<label>표시 이름<input name="label" required autofocus placeholder="예: 우리 팀 장애 알림">
</label>
<label>기존 템플릿 복제<select name="cloneFrom">
<option value="">직접 작성</option>{{#each templates}}<option value="{{id}}">{{label}}</option>{{/each}}</select>
</label>
<label>메시지 JSON<textarea name="body" rows="7" spellcheck="false">{"embeds":[{"title":&#123;&#123;json item.title&#125;&#125;,"url":&#123;&#123;json item.link&#125;&#125;}]}</textarea>
<small>기존 템플릿을 선택하면 해당 본문을 복제합니다.</small>
</label>
</div>
<div class="modal-footer">
<button type="button" class="secondary" data-close-dialog>취소</button>
<button type="submit" class="primary">템플릿 만들기</button>
</div>
</form>
</dialog>
</section>
